# Drop-in embed UI shell CSS

`ghoul-viewer.css` is the drop-in UI shell stylesheet. `embed.html` is markup + a tiny demo page shell.

## Do

- Put UI shell styles in `ghoul-viewer.css`, not inline in `embed.html`
- Scope tokens and resets on `.ghoul-stage-scale` (never host `:root` / `html` / `body`)
- Keep class prefixes (`ghoul-`, `fx-`, `pane-`) and `--gv-*` tokens
- Theme via tokens (`--gv-accent`, `--gv-ink`, `--gv-surface`, `--gv-font`, `--gv-scale`)
- Leave page layout (full-viewport black, centering) in `embed.html` only

## Don't

- Style bare `html` / `body` / global `*` inside `ghoul-viewer.css`
- Hardcode accent/font when a `--gv-*` token exists
- Split the UI shell across multiple CSS files without a clear host-safe entrypoint

## Host drop-in

```html
<link rel="stylesheet" href="ghoul-viewer.css" />
<!-- markup: .ghoul-stage-scale > .ghoul-stage ... -->
<!-- load BMAS Pixel Console, or override --gv-font -->
<!-- set --gv-scale on .ghoul-stage-scale (1–3) -->
```
